### 1. Variables Definition
# @baseUrl = http://localhost/api

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1/api
@contentType = application/json

### 2. Authenticate & Obtain JWT Token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/token/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "email": "daanish@test.com",
    "password": "P@ssword"
}

### Extract the JWT Token dynamically from the login response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.access}}

### 3. Fetch Public Product Catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/items/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 4. Create a New Order (Requires Auth Token)
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "items": [
        {"product": 1, "quantity": 2},
        {"product": 5, "quantity": 1}
    ]
}

### Extract the generated Order ID dynamically from the response
@orderId = {{createOrder.response.body.id}}

### 5. Generate Stripe Checkout Session Link
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/create-checkout-session/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}